SOAPBOX: For us on the NA Left Coast the contest runs from 1700T local. I
SOAPBOX: usually try to make two evenings of this type of timings, however
SOAPBOX: I was called away our Friday. Had a good solo run, out portable
SOAPBOX: in the car. IC-7300 with 1/4 wave whips throughout this time.
SOAPBOX: Had a marvellous time as I usually do with RTTY. Used but the TX
SOAPBOX: Memories in the rig and the tuning/decode features. While much of
SOAPBOX: my booty was out of the US, I had a good run north/south, a small
SOAPBOX: number of VE, one VK9, a number from Japan, and more Euro than I
SOAPBOX: expected! Thank you to all for the contacts, and for digging me
SOAPBOX: out. 73
